<h1><span lang="EN-GB">Stitch</span></h1>
<hr align="left" width="98.974%" size="6" class="whs3">
<p><span lang="EN-GB">This command is accessible from</span> <i style="font-style:normal;"><span class="Path" style="font-weight:bold;"><b>Mesh &gt; Stitch</b></span></i> <span lang="EN-GB">or by pressing</span> <span class="Shortcut" style="font-weight:bold;"><b>Ctrl + T</b></span><span lang="EN-GB">.</span></p>
<p class="description"><span class="Command" style="font-weight:bold;"><b>Description:</b></span> <span class="Command">Stitch</span> <span lang="EN-GB">command attempts to fill the visible selected gaps in the mesh, by joining the boundaries of long thin holes. This command is grayed if there is no selection or all selections are hidden. It works on partial selections only.</span></p>
<p class="Example" style="text-decoration:underline;"><span lang="EN-GB"><a class="dropspot" href="javascript:kadovTextPopup(this)" id="a2" style="text-decoration:underline;">Example</a></span></p>
<div class="droptext" id="POPUP937533456" style="display:'none'; x-ss-type:dropdown;">
<table cellspacing="5" class="whs4">
<col>
<col>
<col>
<tr valign="top" class="whs5">
<td class="whs6">
<p><span lang="EN-GB"><img src="../mesh/Processing_Meshes_files/image079.jpg" border="0" class="img_whs7" alt=""></span></p>
</td>
<td class="whs8">
<p><span lang="EN-GB"><img src="../mesh/Processing_Meshes_files/image081.jpg" border="0" class="img_whs7" alt=""></span></p>
</td>
<td class="whs9">
<p><span lang="EN-GB"><img src="../mesh/Processing_Meshes_files/image083.jpg" border="0" class="img_whs7" alt=""></span></p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr valign="top" class="whs5">
<td class="whs10">
<p><span lang="EN-GB">Crack that must be stitched</span></p>
</td>
<td class="whs11">
<p><span lang="EN-GB">Selected both sided of the crack</span></p>
</td>
<td class="whs12">
<p><span lang="EN-GB">Stitched crack</span></p>
</td>
</tr>
